ение</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>кг/см</strong><sup>2</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 418px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>2,5</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 116px;\">\r\n<p>Диаметр дымохода</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>мм</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.5312px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>159</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 116px;\">\r\n<p>Объём загрузочной</p>\r\n<p>камеры</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p><strong>л</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.5312px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p>88</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 116px;\">\r\n<p>Объём теплоносителя</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>л</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.5312px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>120</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 116px;\">\r\n<p>Объем</p>\r\n<p>зольного ящика</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p><strong>л</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.5312px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p>48</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 116px;\">\r\n<p>Глубина загрузочной</p>\r\n<p>камеры</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p><strong>мм</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.5312px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p>550</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 116px;\">\r\n<p>Вес котла</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>кг</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.5312px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>410/</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 592px;\" colspan=\"3\">\r\n<p><strong>П